  "title": "Sloppy Joe Casserole",
  "description": "Sloppy Joe casserole made with ground beef and noodles in a savory sauce is an easy way to enjoy the components of Sloppy Joes in a cozy casserole.",
  "authors": [
    "Theresa Harnar"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-10T02:52:15-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-01-22T09:35:53-05:00",
